ies, data and/or facilities) are provided to support Business Continuity & Disaster Recovery (BC/DR) operations."}, {"id": "BCD-01_BCD-01_A09", "name": "assessment-objective", "prose": "responsibility and authority for the performance of Business Continuity & Disaster Recovery (BC/DR)-related activities are assigned to designated personnel."}, {"id": "BCD-01_BCD-01_A10", "name": "assessment-objective", "prose": "personnel performing Business Continuity & Disaster Recovery (BC/DR)-related activities have the skills and knowledge needed to perform their assigned duties."}]}	\N	\N	\N	\N
