ve", "prose": "the frequency with which to conduct cyber threat hunting activities is defined."}, {"id": "THR-07_THR-07_A11", "name": "assessment-objective", "prose": "the event triggering cyber threat hunting activities is defined."}]}	\N	\N	\N	\N
